Template: argent-sentinel-agent/protection-discovery
Type: note
Description: Recommended local-address protection mode: ${RECOMMENDATION}
 Argent Sentinel local-address protection discovery
 .
 Environment: ${ENVIRONMENT}
 .
 Detected public IPv6 addresses: ${ADDRESSES}
 .
 Candidate LAN prefixes: ${PREFIXES}
 .
 ${REASON}
 .
 Sentinel uses this information only to prevent its own enforcement actions
 from blocking addresses that belong to this node or an operator-controlled
 LAN. It does not make the addresses trusted event sources.

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/protection-mode
Type: select
Choices-C: host, lan-prefix, manual, off
Choices: host, lan-prefix, manual, off
Default: host
Description: Local-address protection mode:
 host protects each currently discovered public IPv6 address as an individual
 /128. This is the safe choice for VPS, cloud, virtualized, or uncertain hosts.
 .
 lan-prefix dynamically protects the current public IPv6 prefix reported on the
 selected interface. Choose it only when you own or control the entire prefix.
 .
 manual protects only CIDRs entered by the operator. off disables dynamic local
 protection. Existing static enforcement-protected CIDRs remain in effect.

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/lan-confirm
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Do you own or control the complete detected IPv6 LAN prefix?
 Candidate prefix or prefixes: ${PREFIXES}
 .
 LAN-prefix mode prevents Sentinel-managed enforcement against every address in
 the detected prefix, not just this host. Do not confirm this merely because a
 VPS interface displays a /64.

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/manual-cidrs
Type: string
Description: CIDRs to protect in manual mode:
 Enter one or more IPv4 or IPv6 CIDRs separated by spaces or commas. Dynamic
 entries may be no broader than /24 for IPv4 or /48 for IPv6.

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/protection-warning
Type: note
Description: The requested protection mode was not accepted
 ${WARNING}

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/protection-apply
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Internal local-protection configuration marker
 This value is managed by the package.

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/protection-confirmed
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Internal local-protection confirmation marker
 This value is managed by the package.

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/protection-source
Type: string
Default: safe-default
Description: Internal local-protection selection source
 This value is managed by the package.

Template: argent-sentinel-agent/protection-interfaces
Type: string
Description: Internal local-protection interface list
 This value is managed by the package.
